Modify a Product for an Organization {#boarding-user-merchants-v2-edit-products-modify}
=======================================================================================

Follow these steps to modify a product for an organization:

Click Modify next to the product you want to modify. For information on configuring products, see [Set Up the Transacting Organization and Products (Version 2)](/docs/cybs/en-us/boarding/user/all/ebc/boarding-user/merchants-v2-add-merch-trans-org-prod.md "").{#boarding-user-merchants-v2-edit-products-modify_d15e33}
